# AI Integration Workflow

The CogniLink Assistant integrates with various AI providers and implements RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) for context-aware responses.

## Core Services
- [src/services/AIService.ts](mdc:src/services/AIService.ts) - Main AI service
  - Handles message processing
  - Manages API provider selection (OpenAI/Anthropic/Local)
  - Integrates with embedding service for context
- [src/services/EmbeddingService.ts](mdc:src/services/EmbeddingService.ts) - Embedding service
  - Manages semantic search
  - Handles note embedding generation
  - Implements cosine similarity search

## Data Flow
1. User input is received in [src/components/Chat.tsx](mdc:src/components/Chat.tsx)
2. Message is sent to AIService
3. EmbeddingService finds relevant notes
4. Context is prepared and sent to AI provider
5. Response is processed and displayed with sources

## Configuration
Settings for AI providers are defined in:
- [src/types/settings.ts](mdc:src/types/settings.ts) - Settings interface
- [src/constants/settings.ts](mdc:src/constants/settings.ts) - Default settings

## Message Types
Chat message types and interfaces are defined in [src/types/chat.ts](mdc:src/types/chat.ts)
